('The theatre lent me a coat for rehearsals. I need to return it on Monday, even though our cast dinner is on Tuesday.','Return the borrowed coat on Monday. The Tuesday cast dinner does not extend the loan.'),
('I want to thank the costume team without sounding dramatic.','Thank you for lending me the coat for rehearsals. I appreciate your help.'),
