add('memory','meeting_minutes_not_vote',
('During our club meeting, three people suggested a summer outing. We discussed it but did not vote or decide.','The minutes should record a suggestion and discussion, not an approved outing.'),
('The possible destination was a nearby lake.','You can include the lake as a suggested destination, while keeping the decision status open.'),
('I want the minutes brief and neutral.','Members discussed a proposed summer outing to a nearby lake. No decision was made.'),
('Someone also asked whether people would need transport. We did not resolve that either.','You can add that transport was raised as an open question.'),
('Do the minutes need everyone’s casual comments word for word?','Not necessarily. A concise record can capture the proposal, unresolved questions and any decisions without reproducing every comment.'),
('Write a short paragraph now.','Members discussed a proposed summer outing to a nearby lake. Transport was raised as an open question. No decision was made.'),
('Can I title it “Approved summer trip”?','No. Discussion did not amount to approval, and you explicitly said no decision was made.'),
('What destination was suggested?','A nearby lake.'))
add('memory','picnic_weather_message',
('We will cancel the picnic if there is heavy rain. Light drizzle is not enough to cancel it.','The cancellation condition is heavy rain, not merely light drizzle.'),
('I am taking a blanket and a waterproof cover.','Those are the items you have planned to bring.'),
('Help me ask the others what food they are bringing.','What food are you planning to bring to the picnic?'),
('I do not want to assign dishes yet.','That question asks for their plans without assigning anyone a dish.'),
('One person says the sky looks cloudy. Do we already meet the cancellation condition?','Not from that alone. Clouds do not establish heavy rain.'),
('There is light drizzle now. Write a status message using our rule.','Under our current plan, light drizzle does not cancel the picnic. We would cancel if there is heavy rain.'),
('Keep the heavy-rain rule for later. What did I say I was taking besides the blanket?','A waterproof cover.'),
('Have we actually cancelled it in this conversation?','No. The conditions you reported have not triggered the heavy-rain cancellation rule.'))
